D44KSY9Z","text":"curl、いつの間にか `-X POST` 付ける時の方が多くなった気がする","ts":"1633314240.473800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oFLR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d65625c-4933-4b8f-ae9c-31b890e8d3f6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ファイルダウンロードの場合はそうですねぇ。いつしか API を叩くツールとして使われだしたからだんだん合わなくなっていったのかな。まあでも最新版では対応されたようで :goodpoem:","ts":"1633314180.473300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VRgt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9706a985-c180-47a2-88b5-5e1842539d26","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"curlが主にファイルダウンロード目的で使われた時代なら `-f` の動作も納得か。","ts":"1633313900.471900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1633313910.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7sNHt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cdcec47-ba26-4d3f-a405-3c290abedafe","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁバインドのオプション設定たりないとかそういうことやろ。","ts":"1633313830.471300","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1633313838.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dlco"}]},{"client_msg_id":"776a1a5a-7ba2-4992-889a-1f03a2cd98f6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なんかあとcurlをライブラリで使う時、特にPHP方面で400でbodyが取れないてきな質問がありそうだな。","ts":"1633313818.471000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ia99m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"330abfc7-795a-466c-85a7-18d31ae4cfe0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; (HTTP) Fail silently (no output at all) on server  errors.\nだから、まぁでなくて当然だよね。","ts":"1633313762.470100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MYlV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5243902d-7d15-4e1b-a48e-5011e69ec35c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ですです。スクリプトから curl 使う場合はだいたい付けるオプションです。","ts":"1633313749.469800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2o2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb0309b3-9e4f-43ab-8663-58b6a9bffd25","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`-f` つけた場合は、ですね。","ts":"1633313718.469300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wqkJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2079f218-6a16-4b80-8002-daad1d70c109","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"これはいいことを知った。まあでも逆に言うとそれまではできなかったんですよね","ts":"1633313697.469000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QQkff"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1995d163-08f0-4ac0-add7-91eb1c40e42f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ことしの2/11だわ","ts":"1633313674.468500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o35"}]},{"client_msg_id":"010dabd6-4d3c-4265-ac60-34b381e4677b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://daniel.haxx.se/blog/2021/02/11/curl-fail-with-body/\u003e","ts":"1633313666.468200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8DW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b44e109-a5bf-4602-995a-a29b53801c35","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ですね、私も今見ました。`Added in 7.76.0` どうやら最近(?)追加されたっぽい? これは大勝利のオプションですね！","ts":"1633313657.468000","edited":{"user":"U03C71D7H","ts":"1633313674.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y14k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95d413fc-37bf-44bd-be06-8e10916d18ed","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; See also --fail-with-body.\n`-f` のところにこう書いてあるな。","ts":"1633313617.467400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dz3zr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6e64fb6-cb99-426a-bffa-67ff0bb3ec56","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ああ、-f を使うと出なくなります。サーバがエラーコードを返した時にコマンド自体を失敗扱いにする。スクリプトで使う場合はこの挙動もほしいわけですが、これを使うと body が出ません","ts":"1633313542.467100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Em"}]},{"client_msg_id":"087d5b66-8ba2-4b41-8228-e34729c8a9c9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"具体的にいうとこの3年くらいは出力されて、それを使った記憶がある。それより前は意識してなかった。","ts":"1633313495.466000","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1633313518.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1LhOn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbd13c02-f35f-414f-b17c-a86fecc52c24","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いや昔から出てた気がするんだよね。","ts":"1633313406.464600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sEM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f09f3959-a1b3-4074-a6cf-ae4e24e3a33b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あれ、curl のエラーボディ、以前使ったときはどうやっても出せなくて困った記憶が…最近変わったとかあるのかな?","ts":"1633313379.464400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mCj23"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf54f5c9-adc8-42ac-a4ac-e9c9032da507","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一応Problem Details for HTTP APIsっていうJSONでエラーdetailを返す RFC はあるよ? そういうこと?\n\n\u003chttps://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7807\u003e","ts":"1633313105.463300","thread_ts":"1633313105.463300","attachments":[{"fallback":"        rfc7807    ","id":1,"title":"        rfc7807    ","title_link":"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7807","text":"Problem Details for HTTP APIs (RFC )","blocks":null,"service_name":"datatracker.ietf.org","service_icon":"https://www.ietf.org/lib/dt/7.38.0/ietf/images/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7807","original_url":"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7807"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"bl